The loops in these banks were rendered with tools/make_bank.py from the example engine presets of
enginesound (https://github.com/DasEtwas/enginesound, commit e5fcca587397c0c8ba9c9d24874b951fed74d260):

  big_car_1    example1.esc    big_car_2    example2.esc    rally_car_1  example3.esc
  rally_car_2  example6.esc    synth_car_1  example5.esc    synth_car_2  src/default.esc

